,18,,,,,x,casino-gambler,,,,x,,,,Casino Patron,"While walking through your casino, you see <casino-gambler> drunkenly making out with <random-person-indefinite> on top of casino chips and playing cards.",What will you do?,Tell them to take it outside,<casino-gambler> groaned and vomited after I asked <him/her> to take <his/her> drunk makeout session out of my casino.,-1,-2,Clap for them,<casino-gambler> made a mess of my casino during a hot-and-heavy makeout session with <random-person-indefinite>.,-1,3,Throw water on them,<casino-gambler> and <his/her> makeout buddy stormed out of my casino after I doused them with water.,1,-2,Ignore them,I allowed <casino-gambler> to disruptively make out with <random-person-indefinite> in my casino.,,
,18,,,,,x,casino-gambler,,,,x,,,,Casino Patron,"While you're inspecting gambling stations in your casino, you notice <casino-gambler> <weeping/curled in a fetal position/cursing the heavens/howling with grief/quietly crying> after a bad loss.",What will you do?,Hug <him/her>,I gave <casino-gambler> <a tender/a quick/an awkward/a hearty/an A-frame/a lingering> hug after I saw <him/her> <rb> in my casino.,,2,Give <him/her> some free chips,I gave <casino-gambler> <three/five/ten> free chips after I saw <him/her> <rb> in my casino.,1,2,Mock <him/her>,I told <casino-gambler> that <he/she> was <pathetic/worthless/pitiful/unloved and unlucky/doomed to eternal failure> after I saw <him/her> <rb> in my casino.,-1,-3,Tell <him/her> to buck up,"I told <casino-gambler> to <get it together/get back on the horse/get back into the game/buck up, buttercup,> after I saw <him/her> <rb> in my casino.",,-2
,18,,,,,x,casino-gambler,,,,x,,,,Casino Patron,"While you're <counting money/checking inventory> in your casino, you notice that <casino-gambler> is trying to bribe a dealer in order to let <him/her> win.",What will you do?,Kick <him/her> out,I told <casino-gambler> to <leave/get out/skedaddle/get lost/scram/beat it/hit the road/scoot on out> once I realized that <he/she> was trying to bribe a dealer.,2,-3,Tell <him/her> quietly to stop,I pulled <casino-gambler> aside and told <him/her> to <stop it/cut it out/knock it off/lay off the nonsense> once I realized that <he/she> was trying to bribe a dealer.,1,-2,Flash <him/her> a thumbs-up,I <grinned/smiled/flashed a smirk> at <casino-gambler> and gave <him/her> a thumbs-up once I realized that <he/she> was trying to bribe a dealer.,-3,3,Ignore <him/her>,"I saw that <casino-gambler> was trying to bribe a dealer in my casino, but I ignored <him/her>.",-2,2
,18,,,,,x,casino-gambler,,,,x,,,,Casino Patron,"You're chatting with guests at your casino one <morning/afternoon/evening> when you notice that a <bachelor/bachelorette> party, including <casino-gambler>, has started screaming and waving <inflatable genitals/inflatable adult dolls/disturbingly-shaped pool floaties> around.",What will you do?,Join in,I joined a wild <rb2> party in my casino that <casino-gambler> was attending and spent time cavorting with the <rb2>.,-2,3,Ask them to quiet down,"I asked <casino-gambler>, who was attending a bachelor party in my casino, to lower the volume and stop shoving bachelor in other gamblers' faces.",1,-1,Confiscate their toys,I confiscated <rb3> from <casino-gambler> and the rest of a <rb2> party so that other patrons could gamble in peace.,3,-2,Encourage their gambling,I told <casino-gambler> and the rest of a <rb2> party that they could do whatever they wanted with their <rb3> as long as they kept spending money.,-2,2
,18,,,,,x,,,,,,,,,Casino Prospects,"You learn that a new casino is opening up down the road from <hero-casino>, potentially competing with your business.",What will you do?,Mount a smear campaign,"I made anonymous comments on <4Chan/Twitter/Instagram/TikTok/Reddit> saying that a rival casino <was completely rigged/was overrun with rats/failed a fire inspection/was a front for a smuggling ring/had watered-down drinks/was only for washouts, losers, and creeps>.",1,,Brush off the threat,I told myself that that some <flop/stupid/pathetic/dud> casino opening near my own meant nothing.,-1,,Run a promotion,"When a rival casino opened up near <hero-casino>, I ran a promotion promising patrons free <beer koozies/sweatshirts/cocktails/chicken nuggets/chocolate bars/ice cream sandwiches/branded pens> if they came to my casino instead.",3,,Cry,I <broke down in tears/wept copiously/choked up/lamented my fate> when a rival casino opened up near <hero-casino>.,-2,
,18,,,,,x,casino-gambler,,,,x,,,,Casino Employee,"As you're walking through your casino, <casino-gambler> tells you that one of your best dealers was <rude/flippant/dismissive/distant/arrogant/disrespectful> to <him/her>.",What will you do?,Fire the dealer,I immediately <fired/axed/sacked/terminated> a dealer after learning he had been <rb> toward <casino-gambler>.,-2,3,Ignore <him/her>,"<casino-gambler> was complaining about a dealer being <rb> to <him/her> in my casino, but I ignored <him/her>.",1,-2,Dismiss <his/her> concerns,"When <casino-gambler> complained about one of my top dealers being <rb> toward <him/her>, I assured <him/her> that the dealer in question was <one of the best in the biz/professional to a fault/completely on his game/my employee of the month>.",2,-3,Give <him/her> a free drink,"<casino-gambler> complained that a dealer was <rb> toward <him/her>, so I slipped <him/her> <a beer/a glass of wine/a shot of tequila/a dry martini/a whiskey, neat/a rum and Coke/a gin and tonic> on the house.",2,2
,18,,,,,x,casino-gambler,,,,,,,,Casino Patron,You're helping <monitor CCTV footage/restock beverages/fix machines> in the back rooms of your casino when <casino-gambler> barges in and demands a tour of the off-limits sections.,What will you do?,Give the tour,"After <he/she> asked for a tour, I showed <casino-gambler> the <accounting office/employee break room/employee bathrooms/uniform laundry/employee cafeteria/top-secret bunker> in the off-limits section. ",-2,3,Politely ask <him/her> to leave,<casino-gambler> asked me for a tour of my casino's off-limits areas but left without much fuss after I politely informed <him/her> it would ruin the <mystique/allure/glamor/fun/enjoyment> of the casino experience.,1,,Throw <him/her> out,I <ejected/ousted/expelled> <casino-gambler> from my casino after <he/she> <aggressively asked for/demanded/insisted on> a tour of the off-limits areas.,1,-3,Rudely ask <him/her> to leave,"After <he/she> demanded a tour, I <forcefully/snidely/bluntly/disrespectfully/contemptuously> asked <casino-gambler> to get out of the off-limits area in my casino.",1,-2
,18,,,,,x,,,,,,,,,Casino Employee,"While examining the <yearly reports/balance sheets/pay stubs/game payouts/takings per table> for your casino, you realize that one of your dealers is stealing from you.",What will you do?,Fire her,"I <fired a dealer/gave a dealer the boot/kicked a dealer to the curb/told a dealer ""don't let the door hit you where the good Lord split you""/axed a dealer/sacked a dealer> once I realized she had been stealing from my casino.",2,,Hope the problem goes away,I learned that a dealer was stealing from my casino but decided to just let the problem sort itself out.,-3,,Demand that she stop,I learned that a dealer was stealing from my casino and told her to <cut it out/quit it/stop it/give it up/back off my money/get her grubby paws off/put her sticky fingers away> or she'd regret it.,1,,Out her on social media,"I learned that a dealer was stealing from my casino, so I exposed her <crimes/misbehavior/misdeeds/shenanigans> on <TikTok/Reddit/Twitter/Instagram>.",-2,
,18,,,,,x,casino-gambler,,,,x,,,,Casino Patron,"You're <watching live CCTV footage/walking through your casino> when you see <casino-gambler>, who's been at <hero-casino> all day, pull down <his/her> pants and <pee/poop> on the floor rather than use the bathroom.",What will you do?,Clean it up,"After seeing <casino-gambler> <rb2> on the floor of my casino, I <held my nose/grabbed a mop/steeled myself> and cleaned up the mess.",-1,1,Make <him/her> clean it up,"After I saw <casino-gambler> <rb2> on the floor of my casino, I put a <mop/can of room deodorizer/bottle of bleach> into <his/her> hand and forced <him/her> to clean it up.",,-3,Pretend you didn't see,"I witnessed <casino-gambler> <rb2> on the floor of my casino, but I pretended not to see it and just ignored the <stench/smell>.",-4,1,Admire <his/her> commitment,I witnessed <casino-gambler> <rb2> on the floor of my casino and told <him/her> I was in awe of <his/her> <dedication/commitment/faithfulness> to uninterrupted gaming.,,
,18,,,,,x,,50,,,x,,,,Casino Prospects,"While you're <inspecting/walking around/checking operations in> your casino, you see that the mayor of <city> has come for a visit.",What will you do?,Give <him/her> the VIP treatment,"The mayor of <city> visited my casino, and I gave her as many <cocktails/turns at the high-limit tables/games with the best dealers> as she wanted.",2,,Give <him/her> a few game vouchers,I gave the mayor of <city> a few game vouchers when she visited my casino.,1,,Insult <him/her>,"I called the mayor <insult> when she visited my casino, causing her to storm out.",-3,,Shrug and move on,"The mayor of <city> visited my casino, but I was <indifferent/apathetic/too busy to care/unimpressed/focused on other patrons> and didn't give her any special attention.",-2,
